      "cooked": "<p>Another quickie from me!</p><p>A few environment cards say that a hero can skip thier turn to destroy that card, but can an incapped hero do that? Is using one of thier incapped effects classified as a turn? I know they can't discard cards\\hands as they dont have any but do they still take a 'turn' as such?</p><p><span>Cheers!</span></p><p>Si</p>",
