    {
      "id": 95482,
      "name": "Edwin",
      "username": "Edwin",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-11T22:36:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Note however that an active hero <em>can</em> \"discard their hand\" if it has 0 cards in it; only incapacitated heroes are ever incapable of fulfilling that condition.&nbsp; However, \"discard X cards\" requires you to actually have X cards to discard.</p><p>Additionally, while incapped heroes have turns, they don't have any of the phases of the turn, and thus cannot skip those phases.&nbsp; Not sure if that matters offhand.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:22:19.887Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
