      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Note however that an active hero <em>can</em> &quot;discard their hand&quot; if it has 0 cards in it; only incapacitated heroes are ever incapable of fulfilling that condition.&nbsp; However, &quot;discard X cards&quot; requires you to actually have X cards to discard.</p><p>Additionally, while incapped heroes have turns, they don&#39;t have any of the phases of the turn, and thus cannot skip those phases.&nbsp; Not sure if that matters offhand.</p>",
