    {
      "id": 95483,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-12T00:22:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hmm, they do still have phases, just not the same phases as active heroes - they still have a Start and an End phase, but between them I suppose they have an \"Incap Ability\" phase or whatever you want to call it. If they had no Start phase, they'd never be able to skip their turn for stuff (eg to get rid of a Meteor Shower, as this specifies the turn-skip happens during the hero's Start phase) or attack another hero if Infected while Afflicted Frenzy with out (dammit, lol).</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:22:19.958Z",
